DrainSage - Lagos Flood Safe | AWS COOL Hackathon MVP
Build vision systems that see, reason, act

PROBLEM:
Every rainy season Lagos floods because drains are blocked. 200+ flood incidents in 2024. We built AI to prevent it.

SOLUTION:
Community takes drain photo → AI detects blockage → Sends SMS alert to LAWMA.

