ARCHITECTURE (COOL Optimized):
- Frontend: GitHub Pages + Netlify (Static Hosting)
- Backend: AWS Lambda on ARM64 Graviton4 - 40% cheaper, low carbon
- Vision: OpenCV 5 + UNet 3.2M Model (See blockage)
- Storage: Amazon S3 (Image Data Lake)
- Reasoning: Amazon Bedrock Claude 3.5 Sonnet (Reason risk)
- Action: Amazon SNS (Act - SMS alert)
- Theme: Build vision systems that see, reason, act

STACK: S3 + Lambda + Bedrock + SNS + CloudWatch
DEMO: Upload any drain photo, get instant blockage % + flood risk.

